好健康状态，增强心肺功能和肌肉耐力，增强更年期妇女适应社会的能力，有助于消除焦虑。</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"subhead rule\">推荐运动</h3>\n      <div class=\"activities\">\n        <div class=\"activity\"><div class=\"icon\">🚲</div>自行车</div>\n        <div class=\"activity\"><div class=\"icon\">≋🏊≋</div>游泳</div>\n        <div class=\"activity\"><div class=\"icon\">♟</div>舞蹈</div>\n        <div class=\"activity\"><div class=\"icon\">🏃</div>慢跑</div>\n        <div class=\"activity\"><div class=\"icon\">♨</div>瑜伽</div>\n        <div class=\"activity\"><div class=\"icon\">♟</div>太极</div>\n      </div>\n      <p>更年期妇女在选择锻炼中应尽量避免肌肉一次性负荷强度过大，合理进行有氧运动，并将合适可以逐渐进行肌肉力量训练。</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"subhead rule\">推荐运动量</h3>\n      <div class=\"quantity\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><b>👣</b><span>6000步</span></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><b>♥</b><span>150次/min</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tip-card\">\n          <div class=\"band\"></div>\n          <strong>锻炼最有力才有明显效果</strong><br>\n          ⏱ 最佳时长为30min/次<br>\n          每周运动2-3次效果明显\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">维持体重</h2>\n        <p>随着年龄的增长，人体的基础代谢率逐渐下降，此外，雌激素分泌的减少将进一步降低女性的基础代谢率。40-49岁的女性每年约[illegible]，50-59岁的可降低10%。从预防慢性病及更年期体力活动的角度，维持正常体重有利于更年期女性健康。</p>\n        <div class=\"bmi-scale\">\n          <div class=\"bar\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"scale-numbers\"><span>18.5</span><span>23.9</span></div>\n          <div class=\"scale-caption\">平衡膳食规律运动BMI</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bmi-row\">\n          <div>\n            <p style=\"margin-left:0\"><strong>计算公式：</strong>BMI=体重/身高的平方（国际单位kg/㎡）</p>\n            <div class=\"scale-figure\">⚖</div>\n          </div>\n          <p style=\"margin:0\">肥胖妇女体重若减轻5%-10%，就能有效改善与肥胖相关的多种异常状况。</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">其他</h2>\n        <div class=\"other-icons\">\n         